{"parse":{"title":"技能图鉴库/料敌机先","pageid":7124,"revid":17035,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E6%96%99%E6%95%8C%E6%9C%BA%E5%85%88&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E6%96%99%E6%95%8C%E6%9C%BA%E5%85%88&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E6%96%99%E6%95%8C%E6%9C%BA%E5%85%88&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>料敌机先</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E6.96.99.E6.95.8C.E6.9C.BA.E5.85.88\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"料敌机先\"><b>料敌机先</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E7%AE%80%E5%8D%95%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"3\">技能详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\"><img alt=\"技能 料敌机先.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/5/54/rvpw6dc6bzkcyqx1z55zrgro7iq0003.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E6%96%99%E6%95%8C%E6%9C%BA%E5%85%88.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/5/54/rvpw6dc6bzkcyqx1z55zrgro7iq0003.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E6%96%99%E6%95%8C%E6%9C%BA%E5%85%88.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/5/54/rvpw6dc6bzkcyqx1z55zrgro7iq0003.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />料敌机先\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><center><b>&#160;技能类别<br /></b>[反应]</center>\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\">&#160;\n<p>（反应）被自身范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">4</font>格内[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">正、侧方</span>]敌人主动单体攻击前，进行[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"先制\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">先制</font></span></span>]，造成<font color=\"#ed7950\">50%</font>物理伤害，击退<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>格，并打断行动，每回合最多触发<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>次。\n<br />处于[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">以弃亡者之名！</font></span>]的警戒期间时:<br />✦受到来自[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">正、侧方</span>]伤害降低<font color=\"#ed7950\">60%</font>。[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"先制\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">先制</font></span></span>]距离增加<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>格，且额外攻击目标<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>次。<br />✦根据[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"多重爆裂\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">多重爆裂</font></span></span>]层数获得对应额外[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"先制\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">先制</font></span></span>]次数(持续1回合)，触发额外[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"先制\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">先制</font></span></span>]次数时，需消耗<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"多重爆裂\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">多重爆裂</font></span></span>]。\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div>\n<div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%AE%89%E5%A8%9C\" title=\"角色图鉴库/安娜\"><img alt=\"头像 安娜.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/8/8e/cl3jbox4657mprmrtd6q7g7st5m8pav.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:70px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">安娜</font></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门内</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div>\n</div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\">关联内容\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left; width:80px;\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div class=\"skill_icon_box\">\n<div data-type=\"@悬浮框/技能2\" data-name=\"以弃亡者之名！\" class=\"bili-tt skill_icon_bg\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E4%BB%A5%E5%BC%83%E4%BA%A1%E8%80%85%E4%B9%8B%E5%90%8D%EF%BC%81\" title=\"技能图鉴库/以弃亡者之名！\"><img alt=\"技能背景 传说.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/3/3d/tss9yrnhzwljv1ss561dit2j2ngoe6t.png/70px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%83%8C%E6%99%AF_%E4%BC%A0%E8%AF%B4.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/3/3d/tss9yrnh